## AI-Assisted Development

This project uses AI context to accelerate development. When starting an AI session:

1. Open `bootstrap-prompt.md` and paste it into your AI assistant.
2. The assistant will orient itself using `.ai/context.md`.
3. For schema work, reference `data-model.md` explicitly.
4. For security questions, reference `security.md` explicitly.

Store your AI conversation summaries in `.ai_local/session-summaries/` — never in `.ai/`.

